Third-party programs on this disk
=================================

AmigaPouetDownloader ships some programs written by other people. They are
separate programs, distributed next to pouet.rexx under their own licenses,
which are listed here. The full license texts are in this drawer.


c/bebboget, c/bebboget00
------------------------
HTTPS client for the Amiga.
Copyright (C) 2024-2025 Stefan "Bebbo" Franke <s.franke@bebbosoft.de>

License: GNU General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any
later version. Some parts are public domain. See bebboget.LICENSE and GPL-3.

This is a MODIFIED version of bebboget 1.11, changed in October 2026 by
Alessio Garzi to support TLS 1.3 HelloRetryRequest and ECDHE on the
secp256r1/secp384r1 curves, which servers such as files.scene.org need.

Source code of this modified version:
  https://github.com/Ozzyboshi/bebboget/tree/tls13-hrr-nist-ecdhe
Original source:
  https://github.com/AmigaPorts/bebboget
  https://aminet.net/package/comm/net/bebboget

bebboget is the build for the 68020 and up, bebboget00 the one for the
68000. Both are built from the same source.


c/wget
------
Amiga port of GNU Wget 1.10.1 ("wget 1.7 (21.11.2019)").
Copyright (C) 2005 Free Software Foundation, Inc.

License: GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any
later version. See GPL-2.

Original source:
  https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/wget/wget-1.10.1.tar.gz


libs/usergroup.library
----------------------
usergroup.library 4.30 (11.3.2009), needed by wget.
